body: "Follow-up from automated review on unbraind/pm-cli#62.\\n\\nFull-history generation should:\\n- preserve empty release tag windows so tag history is complete\\n- limit matching git tags to tags merged into HEAD\\n- support preparing a pending release window from --release-version before the tag exists, so release-prep output matches post-tag CI checks\\n\\nTracked in pm as pmc-s1c1.\n\n---\n\n### GitHub comments (1)\n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-05-24T16:26:32Z)\n>\n> Fixed in pm-changelog@2026.5.24-15. Full-history generation now preserves empty release windows, filters release tags with --merged HEAD, and supports --release-version as a pending release window for pre-tag release automation. Verified by Daily Release workflow run 26366543310."
